  "bodyHash": "69551cd58ccb54fb",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/847007176350623678-rediscovered-banner.png\" alt=\"undefined\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6ZFAbzj\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.moddinglegacy.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translate-weblate-2ECCAA?style=for-the-badge&logo=weblate&logoColor=white\" alt=\"透過在 Weblate 上翻譯來跨越語言障礙，為 Rediscovered 貢獻力量！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.com%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"如果喜歡我們所做的工作，請考慮在 Ko-fi 上支持我們！謝謝！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"使用 NeoForge 構建\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"關注我們！ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"Follow us! moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"訂閱我們的 YouTube 頻道！\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center;font-style:italic;font-weight:600\">將被棄用的內容和功能重新引入 Minecraft。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🍡 需要 Structure Gel API</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\"><a style=\"font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structure-gel-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:1.4em;text-decoration:underline\">在此下載。</span></a> Structure Gel 是一個旨在幫助開發者更輕鬆創建結構的 API 模塊，特別是使用 jigsaw 系統的開發者。所有代碼均開源且文檔齊全。</p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🆕 最新更新</h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yw8mJgCTOPE\" width=\"978\" height=\"550\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">📚 摘要</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">Rediscovered 重新設想了早期 Minecraft 中棄用的功能和概念，主要專注於 1.0.0 版本之前的內容。雖然存在一些例外，但為了保持一定的控制性，數量並不多。遊戲在多年來發生了巨大變化，因此所包含的功能已被重新設計以符合現代遊戲，很可能不再代表它們最初被考慮時的样子。</p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">☁️ Skylands 維度</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">一個高懸於雲端、遺忘已久的世界。由於長期被遺忘，生命的演化方式與你熟知的過渡世界大不相同。巨型殭屍自由遊蕩，豬進化並形成了自己的功能性社會，曾經被認為已經滅絕的花朵仍在盛開。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/skylands_1.png\" alt=\"Skylands1\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/skylands_2.png\" alt=\"Skylands2\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">地形與以往幾乎一致，與 beta 版完全相同。這裡常生長著一種罕見的櫻桃樹，由於生長時間悠久，往往十分龐大。Skylands 擁有多種氣候的生物群系，從寒冷多雪的森林到潮濕的雨林。若探索足夠深入，甚至可能發現遠疆之地——一個曾被傳為神話的地方。</p>\n<h1 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🔎 探索 Skylands</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">很久以前 Skylands 有進入的方法，目前僅存的痕跡可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fTrail_Ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">小徑遺蹟</a> 中找到。製作一顆 Ruby Eye 即可輕鬆定位。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/ruby_eye_crafting.png\" alt=\"RubyEyeCrafting\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">此眼會指引你前往小徑邊緣的一座建築，其中有一座破損的神秘磚塊傳送門。若加以修復，可使用發現它時的 Ruby Eye 啟動。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/portal_room.png\" alt=\"PortalRoom\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">💎 紅寶石</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">這些紅色寶寶石埋藏於 Skylands、叢林和稀樹草原生物群系的地下，是 Pigmen 的主要貨幣。在過渡世界中，它們以小簇形式生成，偏好更高海拔；而在 Skylands 則數量更多。據說有些人曾誤將其認作綠寶石。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/wild_rubies.png\" alt=\"WildRubies\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🐷 認識 Pigmen</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">通常出現在 Skylands 村莊的大多數 Pigmen 可像過渡世界的村民一樣進行交易。他們非常聰明，對科學和技術感興趣。由於地理位置特殊，某些材料對他們而言價值更高，如石英或燧石。因此，他們願意提供更多交換報酬。他們有五種不同職業，每種職業提供獨特的物品或更容易通過其獲得的物品，包括盔甲、特殊的羊毛顏色，甚至透過研究發現的藥水。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/pigmen_together.png\" alt=\"Pigmen1\"></p>\n<hr style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/pigman_trading.png\" alt=\"Pigmen2\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🛡️ 守衛 Pigmen</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">有些 Pigmen 不感興趣於商業，而是擅長近戰或遠程 combat。若從變成殭屍的狀態中拯救他們，將為玩家提供服務，並在交換紅寶石的同時保衛你。此外，還可為他們裝備武器和盔甲。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/melee_pigman.png\" alt=\"Guard Pigmen\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🧟 Zombie Pigmen</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">最有趣的 Pigmen 之一可能是 Zombie Pigmen。偶爾在終界與殭屍化的 Piglins 共同出現。類似於殭屍村民，可用金黃蘿蔔而非蘋果治療。若給予近戰或遠程武器，治愈後可成為相應型別的守衛；否則將照常作為商人交易。Pigmen 最初如何來到這兒仍成謎團。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/zombie_pigman.png\" alt=\"Zombie Pigmen\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🧱 磚塊金字塔與紅龍</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">一座巨大的神秘磚塊建築，通常孤零零地坐落在浮島之上。金字塔頂部有一個受內部能量保護的石柱。憑藉該能量，保護並鎮息圍繞建築飛行的紅龍。由你決定定位並關閉內部能量。完成後石柱失去保護而被摧毁，激怒龍族。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/brick_pyramid.png\" alt=\"BrickPyramid\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/red_dragon.png\" alt=\"RedDragon\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">孵化紅龍蛋</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">若有能力擊敗紅龍，將留下龍蛋。可用龍息為卵受精，開始長達數日的孵化過程。期間如需移動仍可搬運。孵化完全長成後，最多兩名玩家可騎乘。若取得定制龍裝甲，甚至可裝備其上。它可用於往返過渡世界與 Skylands！但需小心，飛翔過久會耗盡龍力，若處境危險可能致命。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/riding_red_dragon_flying.png\" alt=\"RidingRedDragonFlying\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/riding_red_dragon_grounded.png\" alt=\"RidingRedDragonGrounded\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">紅寶石笛子</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">若龍迷失方向，可製作紅寶石笛子，只要距離夠近聽到鳴叫聲便可召喚它回來。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/ruby_flute_crafting.png\" alt=\"RubyFlute\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">終界反應堆</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">若幸運獲得終界之星，可製作出終界反應堆核心並建造反應堆。使用後可在半徑範圍內施加效果，使部分生物 behave 如同在終界中一般。这意味着 Piglins 和 Hoglins 可安全遊蕩，若未噴灑金色護符藥水則 Pigmen 會變為殭屍。護符還可增強範圍內造成的傷害。若用下界合金塊代替金塊建造，效果會更強大！利用這古老技術創造奇蹟吧！</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/nether_reactor_crafting.png\" alt=\"NetherReactorCrafting\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important text-align: center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/rediscovered/nether_reactor_activation.gif\" alt=\"NetherReactorActivation\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f09411;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🌐 翻譯 Rediscovered - 打破語言障礙！</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify!important\">所有譯者皆於此署名。感謝 OneSkyApp，讓您輕鬆翻譯！</p>\n<p><a href=\"undefined\" rel=\"nofollow\">undefined</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/saudiarabia.png\" alt=\"Flag for اللغة العربية (alLuġah al&#x27;Arabiyye)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>阿拉伯語 (alLuġah al'Arabiyye) 譯者：radientzarka</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/bulgaria.png\" alt=\"Flag for Български (България)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>保加利亞語 (България) 譯者：Unknown</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/czechrepublic.png\" alt=\"Flag for Čeština (Česko)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>捷克語 (Česko) 譯者：Martin P, frantisekbenes65, Lunatica</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/germany.png\" alt=\"Flag for Deutsch\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>德語 譯者：DeutschCraft, Strongamov, A1403</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/argentina.png\" alt=\"Flag for Español (Argentina)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙語（阿根廷） 譯者：patriciofagetti</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Español (España)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙語（西班牙） 譯者：Emerald_God, Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/mexico.png\" alt=\"Flag for Español (México)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙語（墨西哥） 譯者：Vamacher0n</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Euskara (Euskal Herria)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>巴斯克語 (Euskal Herria) 譯者：josebaizairiondo</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/iran.png\" alt=\"Flag for فارسی (Fārsiy)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波斯語 (Fārsiy) 譯者：khbatwyy63</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/france.png\" alt=\"Flag for Français (France)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>法語 (France) 譯者：Drenay, Sixore</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/israel.png\" alt=\"Flag for עברית (&#x27;Ivriyþ)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>希伯來語 ('Ivriy&thorn;) 譯者：Ido Dana</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/hungary.png\" alt=\"Flag for Magyar (Magyarország)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>匈牙利語 (Magyarország) 譯者：Akosjun</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/italy.png\" alt=\"Flag for Italiano (Italia)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>意大利語 (Italia) 譯者：Mcrowser</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/japan.png\" alt=\"Flag for 日本語 (Nihongo)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>日本語 (Nihongo) 譯者：お馬, Vamacher0n</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southkorea.png\" alt=\"Flag for 한국어 (Hangugeo)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>韓國語 (Hangugeo) 譯者：ㅂㄹ, uerop22</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/netherlands.png\" alt=\"Flag for Nederlands (Nederland)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>荷蘭語 (Nederland) 譯者：alexander</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/poland.png\" alt=\"Flag for Polski (Polska)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波蘭語 (Polska) 譯者：MineFrank, Jengordyn, CruveHD, blepszy35, gostek37, prismatic.fractal.official, Wojobart</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/brazil.png\" alt=\"Flag for Português (Brasil)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>葡萄牙語（巴西） 譯者：Mikeliro, Tutis64, yurilegal523, jo123654, renan2nd, caacneto</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/portugal.png\" alt=\"Flag for Português (Portugal)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>葡萄牙語（葡萄牙） 譯者：casperskyloard137</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddingle